    "title": "🎁 Freebies Up for Grabs in Olympia - Furniture, Books & More - NewsBreak",
    "text": "1 days ago Looking to refresh your home or garden without spending a dime? Olympia neighbors are giving away some great free items this week — from comfy couches to garden pots and even textbooks.\nFree Couch (Downtown Olympia) Condition: Good | Size: 7 x 38 x 36 | Location: Columbia St SW near 10th Ave SE\nA 7-foot sage chenille couch with reversible cushions and a wood base. Available through April 22 before it’s hauled away.\n👉 See this item on Craigslist\nDresser and Bookshelf for Free Condition: Used – Fair | Location: Lacey, WA\nA matching dresser and bookshelf ready for a new home. Great for a bedroom or storage space.\n👉 See this item on Facebook Marketplace\nReclining Couch and Loveseat Set Condition: Used – Good | Location: NE Lacey\nA reclining sofa and loveseat set with working mechanisms and removable backrests. Must haul away.\n👉 See this item on Facebook Marketplace\nFree Household Lot Condition: Used – Good | Location: Olympia, WA\nIncludes a couch, dresser, bathroom mirror, small bookshelves, and two grills . Message the poster for pickup details.\n👉 See this item on Facebook Marketplace\nFree Training Potty Condition: Used – Good | Location: Olympia, WA\nA training potty missing the flush attachment. Can meet at Goodwill on Cooper.\n👉 See this item on Facebook Marketplace\nFree Plastic Containers Condition: Used – Good | Location: Olympia, WA\nA batch of plastic storage containers — handy for organizing your home or garage.\n👉 See this item on Facebook Marketplace\nPlanting Pots Location: West Olympia\nA mix of plastic, pottery, and concrete planting pots — perfect for spring gardening.\n👉 See this item on Craigslist\nLawn Irrigation Parts Location: West Olympia\nAssorted hoses and sprinkler parts left by a previous homeowner. Great for DIY lawn projects.\n👉 See this item on Craigslist\nRed Metal Daybed with Bedding Condition: Good | Location: Ovation at Oak Tree, Lacey, WA\nA red metal daybed with bedding included. Must pick up — no delivery.\n👉 See this item on Nextdoor\nDishes Condition: Used – Good | Location: Lacey, WA\nA set of free dishes ready for pickup.\n👉 See this item on Facebook Marketplace\nNeuroscience Textbooks Condition: Used – Good | Location: West Olympia\nA collection of neuroscience textbooks from the late 1990s to early 2000s. Great for students or collectors.\n👉 See this item on Facebook Marketplace\nBooks – Take All Condition: Used – Good | Location: Lacey, WA\nA bundle of free books — take them all and enjoy some new reads.\n👉 See this item on Facebook Marketplace",
    "summary": "Olympia neighbors are giving away some great free items this week — from comfy couches to garden pots and even textbooks. Free Couch (Downtown Olympia) Condition: Good | Size: 7 x 38 x 36 | Location: Columbia St SW near 10th Ave SE A 7-foot sage chenille couch with reversible cushions and a wood base. 👉 See this item on Facebook Marketplace Reclining Couch and Loveseat Set Condition: Used – Good | Location: NE Lacey A reclining sofa and loveseat set with working mechanisms and removable backrests.",
